              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How do you buy one way in? (Una entrada, por favor.) How do you ask for your coins back? (¿Y el cambio?.) How do you say the baby's name, and your own partner? (El nombre del bebé; mi pareja.) And two ways to report yourself? (Tengo calor; mi edad.)"
